WEBVTT

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.210
Fal, are you really sure?

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:08.580
Yeah...

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.880
It's fine.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.250
I've already decided, so...

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.290
I am truly... so sorry...

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.000
For being an incompetent king...
For being an incompetent father...

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.750
Don't cry, Father!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.130
I'm going to be of service, right?

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.380
So, don't worry about it, you know?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.290
This is...

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.130
This is how it should be...

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.920
Wow, the descendant of the hero, huh?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.750
I can't really say that proudly yet, though...

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.330
So then, you and Al-kun...

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.420
What's your relationship to him?

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.540
Um, we shared a life or death fate,
so to speak...

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.920
If that's the case, I also... Uh...

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.920
Anyway, nice to meet you.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.250
Nice to meet you too.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.710
Thank goodness...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.790
It seems like they'll be able to get along well...

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.630
I'll never give him up!

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.580
Well, that's my line!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.380
<b>The Farmer and the Princess's Resolve</b>

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.880
These eckplants look more delicious
than the ones at the market...

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:51.830
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.080
Al-kun! Morning!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.540
We've come to help you out with the harvesting!

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.170
Hang on, what's going on?

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:00.330
Who's that kid?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.880
He took some eckplants.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.040
You shouldn't do such a thing.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.500
I'm sorry.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.830
Absolutely!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:12.210
These weren't supposed to be picked yet, you know?!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.880
They just bore fruit, so even if you eat them,
they don't taste good!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.330
That's what you meant?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.880
If you thoroughly ripen them, their umami increases
and they would've gotten ten times bigger...

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.920
Why...?

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.330
Why?!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.580
Why didn't you wait until then?!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.580
Why is that what you're getting angry over?

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.920
I'm sorry...

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.830
Here...

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.040
This is ripe enough to eat... It's tasty.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.330
Yum!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.130
Th-thank you!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.380
Have someone cook that for you!

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:52.880
Yum! This is tasty!
Have someone cook that for you!<b></b>

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.380
Yum! This is tasty!
Next time, wash them before you eat them!<b></b>

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.130
Next time, wash them before you eat them!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.080
The monsters...

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.670
Because of the attacks by the monsters,

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.710
the distribution of goods
from other countries have stopped...

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.500
"Attacks by the monsters"?

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.710
They started occurring frequently since
around the time you went to Lurugus.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:20.670
Because of that, the prices of commodities have soared,
and the poor can't even buy food now.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.790
So, that's how it's been...

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.540
The monsters again!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.670
Let's go!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.080
Luke-san!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.420
Al! You came!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.710
These bastards are extremely violent! Be careful!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.580
Honestly, with these attacks continuing this much,
we can't last long!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.580
Not to mention this multitude...

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:55.630
Listen up!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.580
For the sake of the country,
there's no way we can retreat here!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.670
We absolutely have to hold the monsters back!

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.830
Aye!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.330
Leave this area to me!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.290
All of you get to protecting the rear!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.330
Helen!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.880
You're beyond fabulous!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.460
Explode!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.790
Helen-san, when did you...

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.830
Amazing...

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:23.630
Luke!

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.540
You saved my life...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.460
Wow!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.880
At any rate, aren't there too many?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.250
Yeah, if it's like this, it'll be never-ending!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.880
That flag is...

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.960
In the name of the King of Antisberg, I command you!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.380
Monsters! Disperse at once!

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.380
Otherwise...

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:33.880
this Sacred Sword Lævateinn
will burn through you miserable scoundrels!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.710
The monsters are retreating...

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.500
With this, we have protected Meigis!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.380
Yeah!

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.960
A sacred sword that repels monsters, huh?

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.580
What?!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.540
Fal?!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.330
I came to say goodbye...

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.580
Huh?

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:39.580
What do you mean by, "goodbye," Fal?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.580
It's been decided that...
I'll be going away from here.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:49.330
Here, as in you'll be leaving Meigis?

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:50.830
Yeah...

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:54.330
So... When will you be coming back?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:00.630
I won't... be coming back anymore.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.790
What?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.290
That's why...

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.130
This is goodbye...

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.250
Fal-sama, it's almost time...

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.880
My apologies. I'm coming.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.380
So long, Al-kun.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.460
Take care.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.630
Fal... Wait a sec!

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:27.880
Hey, Fal!

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.080
Thanks for everything.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.880
What in the world is...

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:39.250
Goodbye...

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.080
Al-kun...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.630
What's going on?

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.670
Thanks to the Sacred Sword,

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.420
the monsters haven't appeared since then.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:07.710
Because of that, trading has returned to normal,
and daily life has come back to the towns.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.000
But...

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.710
Ever since then, Fal has...

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:15.750
Um...

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.920
This child caused trouble for you the other day...

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:22.330
Come on!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:26.790
On top of that, he even received vegetables from you,
so I don't know how to thank you for that...

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.080
Oh, no, that's not...

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.540
That cabbash I got from you
the other day was super yummy!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.330
Hey!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.960
Is that so? Glad to hear that.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:39.830
I'm happy just knowing that the vegetables
I grew are making a tasty meal for someone.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.710
I work as a tailor in town.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:46.000
If there is anything I can do for you,
then please let me know anytime.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.580
You know, Ma's clothing gets good reviews!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.080
I see. That's great.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.330
Also, may I buy some vegetables?

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.540
Oh, of course!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.500
Today's recommendation is potatas, I think...

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.500
We'll be waiting!

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.290
Ma will make any kind of clothes for you!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.250
Okay!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.330
See ya!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.790
Reaks, wh-when did you...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.500
Hello, I've come to deliver the mail.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.710
Is it from Mom again?

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.960
Sorry for the trouble, as always...

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.670
Oh no, this is my job.

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:24.500
More importantly, you have a reputation that
the vegetables from your fields are cheap and delicious.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.000
It makes me happy to have you say that.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:30.880
Because the monsters are no longer appearing,
the prices of commodities have also stabilized.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.380
It's thanks to the Sacred Sword of Antisberg.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:38.250
They're a rather kind country to go out of their way
to come save another country, you know?

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.500
I don't know about that...

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:41.580
What?

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.210
Oh, nothing...

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:46.290
Anyway, here's the extra edition
that was just distributed.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.250
Huh?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.500
What?!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.580
Thanks for the hard work, Ruri-chan.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.710
Helen-san, um...

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.210
You must be hungry, right?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.460
Want to eat with me?

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:03.830
Looks delicious! I'll eat! I'll eat!

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.710
Yum!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:08.040
Yum! It's really yummy!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.170
The extra edition that was just distributed...
Yum! It's really yummy!<b></b>

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.290
The extra edition that was just distributed...
Yum! Yum! Yum!<b></b>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.290
Did you see it?
Yum! Yum! Yum!<b></b>

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:11.960
Huh?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.000
It says that Princess Fal is getting married.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:20.040
Hang on, the husband-to-be is...
the prince of the Kingdom of Antisberg.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.330
A while ago...

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.170
He drove off the monsters with a sacred sword...

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.250
Yeah, that's right.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.080
Although I appreciate that they can
protect Meigis with that sacred sword,

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:35.250
I hope it's not a marriage of convenience
for the princess, just for that reason.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.630
So, about that...

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:43.170
You see, fundamentally, monsters aren't supposed
to be able to understand human words.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.960
And yet, would they really
have listened that obediently?

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.580
Now that you mention it,
that is strange for sure...

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.540
Helen-san!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.540
Al-kun.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.630
Have you seen Filia recently?

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:57.080
No. I haven't seen her of late.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.290
I think it's already been about ten days or so.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.670
Just as I thought...

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.420
Oh, the extra edition?

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.830
Did you see it too?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.130
Yeah, I just found out.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.960
Actually, there's something
I want the two of you to see.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.420
A letter?

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:13.380
It's a letter from my mom, but...

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.500
"Al, I adore you. I love you!"

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.920
Don't mind that!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.580
But...

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:22.380
Don't. Mind. That!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.830
H-here! Please read it from here!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:25.880
From here!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.830
"Al, love you, love you. I love you fiercely."

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.250
Don't piece them together!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.380
Yes, yes...

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.880
"I hear the monsters were frequently
attacking Meigis up until just recently.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.170
Because of that, I heard the
distribution of goods were delayed.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:45.960
I'd thought I'd knock down any monsters
who'd cause difficulties for my precious Al, but..."

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:47.040
Is this...

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.380
A little further down...

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.540
"As I was investigating,
I found out something unexpected.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:56.830
It's in regard to that sacred sword, but...
That thing doesn't have any powers."

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.670
What?!

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.420
The surprise is yet to come.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.500
"That is neither a legendary sacred sword
nor anything in particular.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:05.080
The one who made it is a run-of-the-mill blacksmith."

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.880
Hang on, this kind of intel is...

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.670
Where in the world did this...

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.580
Try reading a little further down.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.630
Further down?

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:15.580
"Well, your mom here was the former commander
of the 'Shadow Puppets,'

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.830
so, something like this is a piece of cake."

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.170
Oh, I see.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.630
Okay, sure...

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.170
Wait, what?! The Shadow Puppets?!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.880
Al-kun, your mom?!

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.040
Did you know?!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.670
Actually, what are the Shadow Puppets?

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:30.960
You don't know?!

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:37.380
The Shadow Puppets are an intelligence unit
known for being able to retrieve any information,

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:39.210
no matter how secret it is.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.500
Your mom, huh?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:44.170
Mom is full of mysteries...

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.830
I'll read the rest.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:49.460
"So, from here is what's most important, but...

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:53.960
The one who's summoning the swarm of monsters
to Meigis is a single demon."

00:13:55.670 --> 00:14:00.670
"And that demon's sweetheart has been taken
as a hostage, so he's doing this unwillingly...

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.880
You understand what that means
after reading that, right?"

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:08.210
Does that mean Antisberg
was using a demon to attack Meigis?

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:09.880
They set this up to gain gratitude,

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.830
and then requested the hand of the princess
in exchange for further protection!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:16.130
Yeah! That's why I want to go save Fal!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.380
Huh? What?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.460
You call the princess, "Fal"?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.630
Is she an acquaintance? Or possibly even...

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.460
What?! Oh no, it's not like that! Um...

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:32.210
F-for us citizens of Meigis,

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.500
Fal-sama is, well, you know, two hearts beating as one,
or rather, she's a true friend, or I mean...

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:38.670
She's that important of a princess to us, right?!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:40.380
That's true...

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:42.330
It's exactly as you said.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.750
There's no way we can just leave
the Princess as is!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:50.790
You're right, but it seems difficult
to get into Antisberg.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.750
They say the screening for immigration
for that country is strict.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:58.080
Don't worry! We have an excellent guide.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.330
A guide?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:00.670
Who?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.500
Have you finished reading the letter about now?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.290
Huh?

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.710
Reaks!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:10.080
Let's do a strategy meeting right away.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.500
Prince Nedilus,

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:24.130
thank you very much for having saved us
from the monsters' attack the other day.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:27.040
We ask that you please continue
to assist us by all means...

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.040
Yes, of course.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.460
In that case, our country would also...

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:34.880
However, regrettably,
we only have one Sacred Sword Lævateinn.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.630
Even now, requests are continuing
to come in from various countries,

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:42.130
and the defense of our own country
is in a slightly precarious situation.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.540
I-if that is the case,
then a tenth of our country's fortune...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.000
No, we will hand over a third of it!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.080
Very well. We will take on the responsibility.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.420
Prince Nedilus!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.000
By all means, please assist our country too!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:59.750
We will sell the goods of trade
at an even lower cost to you than ever before.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.290
If that's the case, then our country too!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.250
Customs duties on Antisberg will be completely...

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.580
Honestly, I can't stop laughing.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:11.000
To have it work so well
that they'd be deceived like this...

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:16.500
I'll enlarge the scale even more, and you will
set about the monsters to attack more countries.

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:18.290
You got that, Gazelle?

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.580
No more...

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.500
What?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:29.130
I... don't want to make my comrades
attack humans anymore!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:33.080
Because I don't want them
to be made a sacrifice of any further!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.170
That's true...

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:38.210
It's not as if the monsters get out without injury too.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.250
And the humans too...

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:49.630
You don't have the right to refuse!
If I say to do it, then do it!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:51.880
Or perhaps...

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.380
That beloved girlfriend of yours...

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.880
Are you saying that you don't mind
if she ends up in a horrible state?

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.420
That's...

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.250
Understood...

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.790
As long as you understand.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.250
What is it that you're doing?!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.630
Oh dear, Princess Fal.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.920
To have you see such a disgraceful sight...

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.330
I do not know what has happened,

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.330
but for you to raise your hand
against a servant is...

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:22.170
You are kind, Princess Fal...

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:28.920
However, I cannot lead a country
without being a little strict on the common folk.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.580
This is a necessary education.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:35.960
Prince Nedilus!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.960
What is it? Calm down!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:40.710
My apologies. Given that it's an urgent matter...

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:41.790
Tell me!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.920
It's that the carriage
for the ceremony is delayed.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.500
What?! Honestly, what are you all doing?!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:53.540
You realize ambassadors and members of the
aristocracy from each country will be at the ceremony!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:56.630
If it's a horse-drawn cart, then a substitute
can be arranged right away, but...

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.670
If there are no problems with the quality,
then anything is fine!

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.170
Do it quickly!

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.210
Yes sir!

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.080
Honestly...

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.580
My apologies, Princess.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.710
By the way, I was able to obtain a good wine.

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.670
Would you like to join me?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:18.710
To pray for our future ahead of us
and perhaps have a celebration...

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:21.750
Please excuse me, but I do not drink...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.080
You are serious-minded...

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:28.580
Princess Fal, you have not been
very cheerful since you came here.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.130
Does this country not agree with you?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.130
No, it is nothing like that...

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:38.630
The environment is a little different than Meigis,
but this country is prosperous.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.130
I think eventually you will also be pleased with it.

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.130
Tomorrow's ceremony...

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:50.630
I look forward to it, Princess Fal.

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:03.920
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:06.000
Here are the clothes you ordered.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.210
Wow! These are perfect!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.170
I told you!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.290
Ma's skills are the best of the bunch!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.750
Yeah, that's true!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.250
Did you get a reply?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.130
Yes.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:27.500
According to my associates, the arrangements
have been made to be able to enter Antisberg.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.380
Everything's ready then!

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:30.830
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:33.460
The outfits are right on the mark!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.130
Everything's all set over here too!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.540
All right! We leave immediately then!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:43.290
Then, I'd like all of you to keep heading on
to Antisberg by carriage.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.420
What?

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:48.080
After you've successfully sneaked in,
please take care of freeing the hostage.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:52.790
If you say it's goods for the ceremony,
they should let the carriage pass without objection.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.130
And you, Reaks?

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.790
She's right. What are you going to do?

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:03.670
In order to bring Prince Nedilus' plot to light,
I'll be going out to procure the monsters.

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:08.830
If we can prove the sword is fake in public,
then naturally, the engagement will be called off.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.130
Then the ceremony itself will be canceled.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.290
I see.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:16.290
But how will you go about gathering monsters?

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.790
Ah... Did I not tell you?

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:23.880
I'm a postal worker and a member
of the Shadow Puppets, and...

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:26.580
I'm a demon.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.790
A demon?!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:36.290
You see, there are quite a few demons like me
who disguise themselves and blend in with humans.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:41.040
In the earliest childhood memories I have,
I was being taken care of by Lucica-san

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:44.960
If anything, I'm probably more familiar
with living as a human.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.290
I didn't know it was like that...

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:51.330
Apparently, the demon who's being threatened
fell in love with a human woman,

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.290
and he's been living
in a human country for a long time.

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:57.500
And it seems because of the current peace agreement,

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:01.040
he was rejoicing that he could safely
and openly have a relationship with her.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.290
So, that's how he got exploited by Nedilus, huh?

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:08.540
Even though he likes humans,
he has to make the demonkind attack them...

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:12.080
When I think of how that must feel,
it's inconsolable.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.920
Reaks.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:17.210
Leave it to us. We'll definitely rescue them!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.250
I'm counting on you.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.710
The time has come to commence operation!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.290
Tomorrow is the wedding...

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:39.750
I thought... I'd resolved myself, but...

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.130
Al-kun...

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:47.750
Al? Who's that?

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.040
One more time...

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.540
Even if it's just one more time...

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:55.130
I want to see Al-kun...

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>The Farmer and the Wedding</b>
